Date: Thu, 19 Jun 2025 10:35:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Spacemit/K1: Support K1 SoC chip and MUSE-Pi-Pro board

Feature list:
1. variable service
2. GOP service
3. boot logo
4. smbios (type0, type1, type2, type3, type4, type7, type13, type16, type17, type19, type32)
5. sdcard/emmc boot
6. udisk boot
7. nvme boot
8. usb keyboard input
9. system info display
10. BIOS setup
11. OS loader

Change-Id: Ie880bafa27d29daad32d7eef15c6b0ca0123eccc
