+  @param Mem64Node  Resource info node for 64-bit memory.
+  @param PMem64Node Resource info node for 64-bit Prefetchable Memory.
+
+**/
+VOID
+CreateResourceMap (
+  IN     PCI_IO_DEVICE      *Bridge,
